            <ArticleTitle>Chondromyxoid fibroma of the sternum.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1948-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Primary chondromyxoid fibroma (CMF) of the sternum is quite rare with only four cases documented in the literature. We present a new case of CMF arising from the sternum of a 47-year-old man and compare it with the previous cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
